<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Conditions</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Supportive, non-judgmental summaries of commonly addressed concerns and how integrative plans can help manage them.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--card:#fbffff;--accent:#0b6b5f;--muted:#475569;--radius:12px;--maxw:980px}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#052126;background:var(--bg)}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:28px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
    nav a.logo{font-size:18px;color:var(--accent)}
    h1{margin:8px 0 0}
    .lead{color:var(--muted)}
    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px;border:1px solid rgba(7,9,12,0.04)}
    .card h3{margin:0 0 8px}
    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:800px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    /* reveal */
    [data-reveal]{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .5s ease,transform .5s ease}
    [data-reveal].revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a class="logo" href="index.html">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Our Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="about.html">Team</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>

    <header style="margin-top:18px" data-reveal>
      <h1>Conditions we commonly support</h1>
      <p class="lead">Below are common areas where people choose an integrative, evidence-aware approach. This is educational and not a diagnosis. If you are in crisis, please call your local emergency services.</p>
    </header>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" aria-labelledby="disclaimer" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="disclaimer">Clinical disclaimer & scope</h2>
      <p class="lead">Our materials and consultations are informational and supportive. We do not promise cures. Clinical recommendations are personalized after review of your history, medications, and tests. For urgent or emergency needs, seek immediate care.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cards" aria-label="Conditions list">
      <article class="card" data-reveal>
        <h3>Sleep disturbances</h3>
        <p class="lead">Practical circadian strategies, behavioral supports, and collaboration with sleep medicine when needed. We aim to reduce fragmentation and improve daytime function.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" data-reveal>
        <h3>Chronic fatigue & low energy</h3>
        <p class="lead">A systematic approach: activity pacing, nutrition, targeted testing, and stepwise reconditioning. We prioritize safety and rule-out of medical causes.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" data-reveal>
        <h3>Digestive complaints</h3>
        <p class="lead">Food pattern adjustments, symptom tracking, and selective testing to build an achievable nutrition plan without unnecessary restrictions.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" data-reveal>
        <h3>Anxiety & mood concerns</h3>
        <p class="lead">Psychological skills, lifestyle supports, and coordination with mental health specialists. Medication discussion is part of shared decision-making when appropriate.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" data-reveal>
        <h3>Metabolic issues</h3>
        <p class="lead">Practical changes aimed at glucose resilience, sleep hygiene, and activity structure; we partner with primary care for medical management if needed.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" data-reveal>
        <h3>Multisystem, unclear symptoms</h3>
        <p class="lead">When symptoms cross systems, we prioritize clarity: a structured intake, selective testing, and a time-limited plan to reduce noise and find the high-yield next steps.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" data-reveal>
      <h3>How we work with concerns</h3>
      <ol class="lead">
        <li>Listen closely to the story and context.</li>
        <li>Identify safety issues and necessary medical checks.</li>
        <li>Prioritize 1–3 evidence-informed steps you can implement.</li>
        <li>Iterate with measurement and adjustments that fit your life.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="lead">If your situation involves urgent risk or a medical emergency, please call local emergency services or contact your primary care immediately.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" data-reveal>
      <h3>Want help shaping next steps?</h3>
      <p class="lead">Use our Session Planner on the Offerings page or <a href="book.html">book an exploratory visit</a> to get a clear, prioritized plan.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="lead">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Educational material only. © {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      const reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      function reveal(){
        const items = document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]');
        if(reduced){ items.forEach(i=>i.classList.add('revealed')); return }
        const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries,obs)=>{
          entries.forEach(e=>{ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('revealed'); obs.unobserve(e.target) } })
        },{threshold:0.08});
        items.forEach(i=>io.observe(i));
      }
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',reveal);
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Our Method</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A concise description of the integrative method, pillars of care, and examples of how a focused plan looks in practice.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7f9f9;--card:#fff;--accent:#0b6b5f;--muted:#475569;--radius:12px;--maxw:980px}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#052126}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:28px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
    nav a.logo{font-size:18px;color:var(--accent)}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:18px;align-items:start}
    h1{margin:0}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .pillar{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(7,9,12,0.04)}
    .case{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,107,95,0.04),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:16px}
    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* reveal */
    [data-reveal]{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .5s ease,transform .5s ease}
    [data-reveal].revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}

    @media (max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a class="logo" href="index.html">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Our Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="about.html">Team</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div data-reveal>
        <h1>Method: pragmatic synthesis, not long lists</h1>
        <p class="muted">We combine clinical evidence, lived context, and measurable short cycles so recommendations become things you can try and keep.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="card" style="padding:12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(7,9,12,0.04)" data-reveal>
        <strong>Quick contact</strong>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Call: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        <div class="muted">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px"><a class="cta" href="book.html" style="display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">Start with a Call</a></div>
      </aside>
    </header>

    <section class="pillars" aria-label="Pillars of care" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div class="pillar" data-reveal>
        <h3>Listen first</h3>
        <p class="muted">A structured intake maps priorities, constraints, and what has or hasn’t worked before. This orients everything that follows.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar" data-reveal>
        <h3>Safety & evidence</h3>
        <p class="muted">We check for medical risk and use evidence-light paths where the data are limited—making conservative, reversible plans up front.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar" data-reveal>
        <h3>Small experiments</h3>
        <p class="muted">Short, time-bound trials and simple measurements reduce guesswork and preserve momentum.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" data-reveal>
      <h2>From plan to daily practice</h2>
      <p class="muted">We design one- and two-week sequences that slot into real schedules: morning anchors, midday resets, and a straightforward evening routine when relevant. Plans include simple measurements and a review point.</p>

      <div class="case" data-reveal>
        <strong>Case note — illustrative (fictional)</strong>
        <p class="muted">Patient — 42, irregular sleep, high evening work load. First session: intake and prioritized list. Intervention: stabilize bedtime routine, reduce evening stimulants, 7-day sleep log, and one targeted supplement plan after checking medications. Follow-up: 2 weeks to check adherence and adjust timing. Result: clearer sleep timing and reduced daytime fatigue within three weeks.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" data-reveal>
      <h2>Session Planner (try a sample)</h2>
      <p class="muted">Build a concise plan and export it to share with a provider or to keep for yourself.</p>

      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 220px;gap:12px;margin-top:12px">
        <div class="card" style="padding:12px" data-reveal>
          <label class="muted" for="a-goal">Primary goal</label>
